Run a desktop app in a sandbox

Usage: paddock app <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run        Run an app profile
  install    Add a launcher entry
  uninstall  Remove a launcher entry
  open       Open a link in a running app
  list       List the apps
  stop       Stop a session
  status     Show a session
  add        Add an app bundle as a profile
  remove     Remove an app profile
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
